  {
   "id": "united-assault-battle-of-the-bulge-195231@1.3.1",
   "gameId": "united-assault-battle-of-the-bulge-195231",
   "displayName": "Update 1.3.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-01-24T13:05:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Update Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Update 1.3.1 adds a new, 6 mission long bonus campaign to the game including new achievements and the update to Unreal Engine 5.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "added 6 mission bonus campaign",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "added new achievements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "added new weather conditions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "added ray tracing option",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed mission loading issue",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed weapon pickups",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "fixed several minor issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "updated to Unreal Engine 5.1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "updated and slightly rebalanced AI",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "updated vehicles to use Chaos Physics Engine instead of Physix",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Important Informations",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We started an update progress to Unreal Engine 5 a while ago and abandoned it because of the sheer number of bugs and issues the upgrade brought with it. This time it took us roughly a month to get the game fully working on UE5 with a lot of bugs fixed early on. However there is a potential this update brought with it new until unnoticed bugs we did not catch. Please report all bugs so we are able to fix them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game was not designed around Ray Tracing, which means especially interiours can be to dark at certain weather conditions. We are aware of this and want to correct this with future updates!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Savegames and Progression",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The update to Unreal Engine 5 forced us to rework savegame compatibility. This means with this update Settings and Progressions are reset. There is a way to recover your old progression but this might cause game crashes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Recovering Progress at your own risk",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Open the folder C:\\Users\\DUsername\\AppData\\Local\\UnitedAssault\\Saved\\SaveGames",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Create a subfolder called BotB if it does not already exist",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Copy the file BotB_Progression.sav into the new BotB Subfolder",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Playing the legccy Unreal Engine 4 game (v1.1.0)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The old Unreal Engine 4 version of the game is available legacy branch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Facebook",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
